    user_response: "Apply the \"Immersive UI\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Immersive UI\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <style>:root{--nes-red:#FF0000;--nes-blue:#2432ff;--nes-green:#00e600;--nes-gold:#ffd700;--nes-black:#000000;--nes-white:#ffffff;--f-pixel:\'Courier New\',Courier,monospace}.pixel-border{border:4px solid var(--nes-white);box-shadow:inset -4px -4px 0px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),4px 4px 0px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)}.pixel-btn:active{transform:translateY(2px);box-shadow:none}.sprite-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);width:64px;height:64px}</style><div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-full bg-[#000000] text-white font-mono uppercase overfl