    thinking: "**Verifying Implementation Sync**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the initial sync based on the exact app name \"Hero\'s Habit Run\" is complete. I\'m now cross-referencing this against user instructions, focusing on the \"Immersive\" component to ensure everything is properly integrated and configured. I\'m looking for any discrepancies in the implementation.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completely applied the **Immersive UI** design theme to the application, maintaining all core Room database features, tavern boards, inventories, and correlations, while fully encasing them in a retro Legend of Zelda NES world layout.\n\n### Accomplishments\n\n- **Interactive Retro Gamepad (`ImmersiveGamepad`)**:\n  - **SELECTION (`SELECT`)**: Cycles dynamically between active tabs: **TAVERN** \342\236\224 **CLOSET** \342\236\224 **MORGUE**.\n  - **START (`START`)**: Summons the **Sages\' Scroll of Stats** dialog, presenting overall wisdom XP, daily quest completion progress, and active streak stats, along with a button to replay/refresher the morning check-in questionnaire.\n  - **BUTTON B (`INVENTORY`)**: Tactile red circular button that opens addition screens: *Forge Custom Buff* on the Tavern tab, or *Dump Irritation* on the Closet tab.\n  - **BUTTON A (`COMPLETE`)**: Action button that directly targets and completes the top unchecked habit on the Tavern board, or queues the first irritation in the Closet passive harvest to be swat down instantly.\n\n- **Legend of Zelda High-Fidelity HUD (`HeaderStatsBar`)**:\n  - **LIFE Hearts Display**: Dynamically renders hearts based on active daily streaks (e.g., \342\235\244\357\270\217 \342\235\244\357\270\217 \342\235\244\357\270\217 \360\237\226\244) representation.\n  - **Resource Portals**: Pairs numeric counters with thematic items, including blue rupees (`\360\237\224\267`) for XP wisdom, skeleton keys (`\360\237\227\235\357\270\217`) for passive worry counts, and bombs (`\360\237\222\243`) for active habits.\n  - **Dungeon Indicators**: Displays the real-time calculated level (e.g., *LEVEL-2*) alongside dungeon titles (*EAGLE RUN*) and real-time geographic retro coordinate tags (*MAP POS: 7-G*).\n\n- **Technical Execution**:\n  - Kept all data integrity intact, successfully verified with full unit running and local JVM screenshot test suites."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 441260950
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
