  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Celebrating Build Success**\n\nThe build completed perfectly! I was so pleased to see the applet compile without any issues. It\'s a wonderful outcome, and I\'m eager to move forward with the design review of the character creator functionality.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully created and integrated a fully functional, highly customizable **Character Creator** for the application, designed perfectly with retro NES pixel art mechanics inspired by *The Legend of Zelda*.\n\nHere is a summary of the visual, physical, and technical craftsmanship injected into the application:\n\n### \360\237\216\256 Design & Gameplay Systems\n\n- **Dynamic Hero Assembly Chamber**: Added a custom **HERO CREATOR** dashboard easily accessible from the Tavern Board. In this dialog, users can assemble and view their customized legend:\n  - **Class Selection**: Choose between 4 bespoke classes\342\200\224**Warrior (Hero)**, **Sage**, **Knight**, or **Fairy**\342\200\224each rendered using real-time hand-crafted pixel coordinate maps.\n  - **Outfit Primary Palette**: Customize armor/robe colors with classic NES mail types (Classic Green, Crimson Red, Aquamarine Blue, Golden Armor, or Ethereal White).\n  - **Outfit Secondary Shadow**: Personalize depth joints and hoods (Dark Green, Ruby Shadow, Sapphire Shadow, Leather Brown, or Slate Grey).\n  - **Accessory & Hair Accents**: Retouch locks and sparkles (Triforce Gold, Silver White, Peach, or Fairy Pink).\n  - **Instant Live Preview**: Enjoy a large, glowing, double-bordered 8-bit viewfinder that showcases the assembled pixel grid instantly on selection.\n- **Lore-Rich Tavern Board Interactions**: Modified local dialogue systems and tavern keepers so they dynamically address the user based on their active class (e.g., *\"A pristine day greets you, SAGE adventurer!\"*).\n\n### \342\232\231\357\270\217 Engine & Architecture Enhancements\n\n- **Dynamic Multi-Palette Solver (`ZeldaSprites`)**: Integrated template layers in the sprite parser. The grid compiler replaces base character indexes with the custom colors instantly, replicating original 8-bit hardware palette swaps.\n- **Persistent Character Profiles (Room DB)**: Expanded the `ProfileEntity` schema with columns for the active sprite layout and corresponding colors.\n- **Zero-Latency State Flows**: Wired customization states directly through our `ViewModel` and DB DAO repositories using modern asynchronous `MutableStateFlow` streams, ensuring modifications persist across app relaunches and update all screens instantly.\n- **Comprehensive View Syncing**: Ensured the customized hero sprite is displayed across all panels including:\n  - **Tactical Navigation Bar**: Updates the Tavern tab\'s icon with the user\'s custom character.\n  - **Tavern Board Dialogue**: Renders the custom sprite alongside localized quest lines.\n  - **Morning Check-In Panel**: Greets the user\'s customized avatar at dawn.\n  - **Sages\' Scroll of Stats (Start Menu)**: Highlights the fully-equipped adventurer.\n  - **Conquer Irritations Dialog**: Displays the hero preparing to vanquish passive worries."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 304496534
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
