  user_input {
    user_response: "Add a feature for capturing the order habits are completed in, showing the habit execution order as part of the daily summary. The success of the player\'s daily run is ultimately based on the self reported mood for that day. The mood for the most recently completed day should be captured when the app is first opened on a new day, as habits are reset. Once the mood is entered, a summary of the previous day should show up, showing the order habits were completed in and the mood, along with a recent display of previous day\'s moods to show trends. Clicking into the most recent day should allow for adding, removing, moving habits that were completed. There should be an option to add habits between previously logged ones, if needed, as well as a way to enter general notable events for that day that may have contributed to mood."
    items {
      text: "Add a feature for capturing the order habits are completed in, showing the habit execution order as part of the daily summary. The success of the player\'s daily run is ultimately based on the self reported mood for that day. The mood for the most recently completed day should be captured when the app is first opened on a new day, as habits are reset. Once the mood is entered, a summary of the previous day should show up, showing the order habits were completed in and the mood, along with a recent display of previous day\'s moods to show trends. Clicking into the most recent day should allow for adding, removing, moving habits that were completed. There should be an option to add habits between previously logged ones, if needed, as well as a way to enter general notable events for that day that may have contributed to mood."
    }
  }
